    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive voice and perspective",
     "texto": [
      "The passive (**η ιστορία παρουσιάζεται**) highlights the topic; the agent can be left out or added with **από**. **Από ποια οπτική…;** questions the point of view.",
      "Notice what relationship each connector sets up and use it to express your own position."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
